  "prompt": "Through which channel did registered customers place their latest order of January to June 2025? For each registered customer with an order from 1 January to 30 June 2025 (order_ts holds UTC time; both days included, in UTC), take the latest order in that period. When two orders of a customer tie on order_ts, the one with the lower order_id counts as the latest. Guest orders have a missing customer_id and do not count. Then count the customers by the channel of that latest order. Return two columns, in this order: channel and customers. Return one row for each channel. Any row order is fine.",
